---
question: Give from your IRA+
---
If you’re 72 or older, you may be able to take advantage of the tax benefit of making a qualified charitable distribution (QCD) directly from your IRA. When you direct your QCD to a nonprofit (like us!), you’ll support the abortion pill movement while minimizing paying tax on that distribution. Some gifts can also fulfill Required Minimum Distribution from 401(k) accounts. Consult your tax preparer or banker for more info, and contact {% inlineLink action={discriminant: "mailto", value: "donations@plancpills.org"} _language="" %}donations@plancpills.org{% /inlineLink %} so we can track your gift.
